# What makes a lab test observable, without the SDTM implementation. Start from an SDTM CT
# test code (or test name) and return the BC side of COSMoS with NCIt, plus the SDTM CT terms
# that Dataset Specialization rows bind to the BC's Data Element Concepts.
#
# Run over the union of the base graphs (base/<source>/<source>.ttl), the link graphs
# (linked/links.ttl, linked/by-rule.ttl) and the COSMoS model graph (linked/cosmos-model.ttl).
# No sign-in content is used.
#
# Parameter: the codelist code and the CDISC Submission Value of the test term, set in the
# VALUES line. Example: Laboratory Test Code (C65047), GLUC. Laboratory Test Name (C67154),
# Glucose, gives the same result.
#
# From the term to the BC: the term's NCIt concept (link: sdtm-ct to NCIt) is the NCIt concept
# of the COSMoS BC (link: cosmos biomedical concept to NCIt). No link of ours is added.
#
# Part A, the BC side (every triple of each node):
#   every SDTM CT term with that NCIt concept (for GLUC: GLUC and Glucose);
#   the BC rows with that NCIt concept (one per DEC), the BC hierarchy row they belong to
#   (COSMoS BC model: dataElementConcepts), and its parents (links: cosmos biomedical concept
#   to parent, cosmos hierarchy to parent), with their DECs and Codings (COSMoS BC model:
#   dataElementConcepts, coding);
#   the NCIt concepts of the BCs and DECs (links: cosmos biomedical concept / data element
#   concept to NCIt), with all their ancestors (link: ncit concept to parent);
#   the NCI code-CUI map rows of those concepts.
# Part B, the bound CT terms:
#   from each Dataset Specialization row whose DEC is one of the BC rows (link: cosmos dataset
#   specialization to data element concept), only these triples: its type, that DEC link,
#   and its term links (links: cosmos dataset specialization to assigned term, cosmos value
#   list to term). No other column of the row, and no SDTMIG, SDTM Model or NSV link;
#   every triple of each term row, and of the term's NCIt concept (link: sdtm-ct to NCIt).
# Part C, the Specializations: each COSMoS SDTMGroup (Dataset Specialization) with such a row, with
#   only these triples: its type, datasetSpecializationId (the vlm_group_id), shortName and
#   biomedicalConceptId, and its variables link to the rows of Part B (COSMoS SDTM model).
# Nothing is added: every triple is a triple of the graphs.

CONSTRUCT { ?n ?p ?o }
WHERE {
    VALUES (?codelist_code ?submission_value) { ("C65047" "GLUC") }
    ?start <https://kerfors.github.io/cdisc-for-all/def/sdtm-ct/SDTM%20Terminology#Codelist%20Code> ?codelist_code ;
           <https://kerfors.github.io/cdisc-for-all/def/sdtm-ct/SDTM%20Terminology#CDISC%20Submission%20Value> ?submission_value ;
           <https://kerfors.github.io/cdisc-for-all/link/sdtm-ct/SDTM%20Terminology#Code> ?concept .
    ?bc_row <https://kerfors.github.io/cdisc-for-all/link/cosmos/cdisc_biomedical_concepts_latest#ncit_code> ?concept .
    {
        # Part A: the CT terms with the same NCIt concept
        ?n <https://kerfors.github.io/cdisc-for-all/link/sdtm-ct/SDTM%20Terminology#Code> ?concept .
        ?n ?p ?o .
    }
    UNION
    {
        # Part A: the BC side
        ?bc_row ^<https://www.cdisc.org/cosmos/biomedical_concept_v1.0dataElementConcepts>? ?b0 .
        ?b0 (<https://kerfors.github.io/cdisc-for-all/link/cosmos/cdisc_biomedical_concepts_latest#parent_bc_id> |
             <https://kerfors.github.io/cdisc-for-all/link/cosmos/cdisc_biomedical_concepts_hierarchy_latest#parent_bc_id>)* ?b .
        ?b (<https://www.cdisc.org/cosmos/biomedical_concept_v1.0dataElementConcepts> |
            <https://www.cdisc.org/cosmos/biomedical_concept_v1.0coding>)? ?m .
        ?m (<https://kerfors.github.io/cdisc-for-all/link/cosmos/cdisc_biomedical_concepts_latest#ncit_code> |
            <https://kerfors.github.io/cdisc-for-all/link/cosmos/cdisc_biomedical_concepts_latest#ncit_dec_code>)? ?c0 .
        ?c0 <https://kerfors.github.io/cdisc-for-all/link/ncit-flat/Thesaurus#parents>* ?c .
        ?n <https://kerfors.github.io/cdisc-for-all/link/nci-code-cui-map/nci_code_cui_map#code>? ?c .
        ?n ?p ?o .
    }
    UNION
    {
        # Part B: the Dataset Specialization rows, selected triples only
        ?n <https://kerfors.github.io/cdisc-for-all/link/cosmos/cdisc_sdtm_dataset_specializations_latest#dec_id> ?bc_row .
        ?n ?p ?o .
        FILTER(?p IN (<http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type>,
                      <https://kerfors.github.io/cdisc-for-all/link/cosmos/cdisc_sdtm_dataset_specializations_latest#dec_id>,
                      <https://kerfors.github.io/cdisc-for-all/link/cosmos/cdisc_sdtm_dataset_specializations_latest#assigned_term>,
                      <https://kerfors.github.io/cdisc-for-all/rule/cosmos/cdisc_sdtm_dataset_specializations_latest#value_list/sdtm-ct/SDTM%20Terminology>))
    }
    UNION
    {
        # Part B: the terms and their NCIt concepts
        ?row <https://kerfors.github.io/cdisc-for-all/link/cosmos/cdisc_sdtm_dataset_specializations_latest#dec_id> ?bc_row ;
             <https://kerfors.github.io/cdisc-for-all/link/cosmos/cdisc_sdtm_dataset_specializations_latest#assigned_term> |
             <https://kerfors.github.io/cdisc-for-all/rule/cosmos/cdisc_sdtm_dataset_specializations_latest#value_list/sdtm-ct/SDTM%20Terminology> ?term .
        ?term <https://kerfors.github.io/cdisc-for-all/link/sdtm-ct/SDTM%20Terminology#Code>? ?n .
        ?n ?p ?o .
    }
    UNION
    {
        # Part C: the Specializations, selected triples only
        ?n <https://www.cdisc.org/cosmos/sdtm_v1.0/variables> ?row .
        ?row <https://kerfors.github.io/cdisc-for-all/link/cosmos/cdisc_sdtm_dataset_specializations_latest#dec_id> ?bc_row .
        ?n ?p ?o .
        FILTER(?p IN (<http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type>,
                      <https://www.cdisc.org/cosmos/sdtm_v1.0/datasetSpecializationId>,
                      <https://www.cdisc.org/cosmos/sdtm_v1.0/shortName>,
                      <https://www.cdisc.org/cosmos/sdtm_v1.0/biomedicalConceptId>))
    }
    UNION
    {
        ?n <https://www.cdisc.org/cosmos/sdtm_v1.0/variables> ?o .
        ?o <https://kerfors.github.io/cdisc-for-all/link/cosmos/cdisc_sdtm_dataset_specializations_latest#dec_id> ?bc_row .
        BIND(<https://www.cdisc.org/cosmos/sdtm_v1.0/variables> AS ?p)
    }
}
